1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,749
The Englund Gambit offers a pawn before either side develops.

2
00:00:03,829 --> 00:00:07,577
White takes, but Black gets the queen into the attack.

3
00:00:07,657 --> 00:00:11,406
The bishop check forces an awkward defensive move.

4
00:00:11,486 --> 00:00:15,234
The pawn grab looks free until the queen is chased.

5
00:00:15,314 --> 00:00:19,063
White brings out the knight and attacks the exposed queen.

6
00:00:19,143 --> 00:00:22,891
The center opens while Black spends moves on survival.

7
00:00:22,971 --> 00:00:26,720
The lesson: count development before counting pawns.
